# Spotify Web API (playlist metadata only — no streaming/DSP)
# 1. Create an app: https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# 2. Redirect URI — Spotify does NOT allow "localhost". Use loopback IP:
#    http://127.0.0.1:5173/
#    https://playin432.com/          (production HTTPS)
# 3. Open the app at http://127.0.0.1:5173/ (not localhost) so redirect matches
# 4. Copy Client ID here. PKCE does not need the Client Secret in the browser.

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional override (defaults to 127.0.0.1 when host is localhost)
# VITE_SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:5173/
